{"availability":"available","full":"supermarsx/chancela","name":"chancela","description":"Self-hostable, ledger-backed livro de atas for Portuguese collective entities","category":"Developer tools","language":"Rust","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-06T14:39:33Z","updated":"2026-10-05T05:53:45Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://supermarsx.github.io/chancela/","topics":["api","app","assinatura-digital","associacoes","atas","company-acts","corporate-acts","digital-signature","direito","empresa","empresas","irn","legal","livro-atas","modelos","pdf","servidor","sociedade-comercial","templates","webapp"],"demo":"https://supermarsx.github.io/chancela/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T03:24:33.710Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T03:24:33.710Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T03:24:33.710Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T03:24:33.710Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Rust"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Self-hostable, ledger-backed livro de atas for Portuguese collective entities.","Chancela is a self-hostable platform for keeping a Portuguese-style livro de atas (corporate minute book) and the atos societários — the minutes and resolutions of a company or other entity's governing bodies — that belong in it. Its job is to help you draft, review, and preserve those records through a controlled lifecycle — draft → seal → archive — so that what a general assembly, board, or management body decided stays organized, attributable to the people who authored it, and hard to alter after the fact. User-authored templates give each entity type its own house style, while role-based…","Once an act is sealed it is written to an append-only, hash-chained ledger that can be re-verified on demand: because each entry is chained to the one before it, later tampering breaks the chain and becomes detectable. That makes Chancela a records-integrity tool — it keeps an organized, tamper-evident history of corporate decisions, but it does not claim legal validity or replace notarial and legal requirements. For the acts that call for signatures, it integrates qualified and advanced electronic signatures (PAdES / XAdES / CAdES) over Portuguese rails — Chave Móvel Digital and Cartão de…"],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/supermarsx/chancela/blob/main/readme.md","fingerprint":"685a94c8f5cf99ac27456299c0dca41ae47c214bfad3832d8178594c5f2a7a36","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T03:24:33.947Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T03:24:33.947Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Self-hostable, ledger-backed livro de atas for Portuguese collective entities.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/supermarsx/chancela/blob/main/readme.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"The simplest way to run Chancela is the self-hosted single-node image:","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/supermarsx/chancela/blob/main/readme.md"},{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"Only Chancela combines self-host + append-only hash-chained ledger + PT qualified e-signature (CMD / Cartão de Cidadão) + fixity export/import.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/supermarsx/chancela/blob/main/readme.md"}],"fingerprint":"685a94c8f5cf99ac27456299c0dca41ae47c214bfad3832d8178594c5f2a7a36","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/supermarsx/chancela/blob/main/readme.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T03:24:33.947Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-05T05:53:45Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/supermarsx/chancela/blob/main/readme.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T03:24:33.948Z","hash":"685a94c8f5cf99ac27456299c0dca41ae47c214bfad3832d8178594c5f2a7a36","originalBytes":8032,"storedBytes":8032,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["chancela","docs","docker","qualified","ledger","legal","license","records","single-node","atas","comparison.md","corporate","documentation","one","security","source","acts","append-only","before","build","cart","cidad","desktop